	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0301_hakaim2_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>これって　アレか？
なぐりあって　わかりあう　ってヤツ？▽
つまり　せいしゅん　ってことか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>これって　アレか？
なぐりあって　わかりあう　ってヤツ？▽
つまり　青春　ってことか</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
