	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0301_swplazmaw1_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>ああ！　この　ひとから
あつい　きもち　つたわってくる！▽
こっ　こころが　ゆらいじゃう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-02T03:15:56" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>ああ！　この　人から
熱い　気持ち　伝わってくる！▽
こっ　こころが　揺らいじゃう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-02T03:16:21" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<CommentCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Comment>♀
・元プラズマ団♂その２と戦う
・ゲーチス戦終了で削除</Comment>
			<CommentModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T06:46:20" />
		</CommentCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Character">
			<Text>SWPLAZMAM
プラズマ団♀その１</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-08-23T09:50:22" />
		</AttributeCell>
		<AttributeCell
			Name="Importance">
			<Text>B</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
