		</ExtraCell>
	</TextRow>
	<TextRow
		Label="msg_d10r0301_swplazmam6_01"
		Style="Large">
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN">
			<Text>イッシュを　こおりづけに　して
みんなから　ポケモンを　うばう！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:41:23" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T11:21:23" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>イッシュを　氷漬けに　して
みんなから　ポケモンを　奪う！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="matsumiya:W00224"
				Time="2011-12-13T12:41:20" />
